                "contextual_cvss_reasoning": "The application codebase does not directly import devalue or pass Node Buffer objects through page load() functions. While @sveltejs/kit@2.70.3 transitively depends on devalue@5.9.1, no application route handler (src/routes/*) constructs or returns pooled raw Node Buffers. Consequently, impact metrics are set to None."
