          "message": {
            "text": "Path Traversal / Arbitrary File Read — Ruled out: GET /api/settings/backup/download\n\nThe ?file= parameter in /api/settings/backup/download is sanitized using path.basename(requestedFilename) and strictly matched against backups.find((b) => b.filename === safeName). Arbitrary directory traversal (e.g. ../../etc/passwd) fails the lookup and returns 404 BACKUP_NOT_FOUND. Furthermore, the endpoint is strictly restricted to owner_admin role."
